{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This DLC adds the game Morph Ranger to the collection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Morph Ranger, a compact yet innovative 2D metroidvania platformer originally crafted for a Ludum Dare jam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a small, legless creature lost in a vibrant galaxy, collecting DNA samples to evolve and unlock new abilities. Gain legs to jump, then progress to shooting, double jumping, and melee attacks as you explore colorful, pixel-art worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its short, action-packed gameplay and unique evolution mechanic, Morph Ranger delivers a fresh twist on the genre, blending challenge and creativity in a bite-sized experience. Transform your destiny in this cosmic adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003110?t=1757442682","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003110?t=1757442682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003110/306d6219c4dd13b88d4a3f3319394b14bc268175/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757442682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003110/306d6219c4dd13b88d4a3f3319394b14bc268175/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757442682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This DLC adds the game Morph Ranger to the collection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Morph Ranger, a compact yet innovative 2D metroidvania platformer originally crafted for a Ludum Dare jam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a small, legless creature lost in a vibrant galaxy, collecting DNA samples to evolve and unlock new abilities. Gain legs to jump, then progress to shooting, double jumping, and melee attacks as you explore colorful, pixel-art worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its short, action-packed gameplay and unique evolution mechanic, Morph Ranger delivers a fresh twist on the genre, blending challenge and creativity in a bite-sized experience. Transform your destiny in this cosmic adventure!</p>","developers":["NanningsGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3942710","name":"Infinite Game Cartridge Collection"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003110/03c3e579d1fa631a732ee9c64ea655b69497558b/header.jpg?t=1757442682","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192034,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192034/movie480.mp4?t=1757442679","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192034/movie_max.mp4?t=1757442679"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192034/768739313d1ea85b2c53f51ada7f92032a77c761/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757442679","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192034/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757442679","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192034/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757442679"}}],"name":"Infinite Game Cartridge Collection - Morph Ranger","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["NanningsGames"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}}